{"title": "Brute", "pageid": 4401, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Brute", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Brute</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Bugbear\" title=\"Bugbear\">Bugbear</a> passive feature that causes them to deal extra damage with melee weapons.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Deals an extra <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Physical\" title=\"Physical\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Physical\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Physical\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Physical\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">Physical</span></a> when attacking with a melee weapon. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Bugbear\" title=\"Bugbear\">Bugbear</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bao%27ek%27nuk\" title=\"Bao'ek'nuk\">Bao'ek'nuk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bugbear\" title=\"Bugbear\">Bugbear</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bugbear_Assassin\" title=\"Bugbear Assassin\">Bugbear Assassin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chop\" title=\"Chop\">Chop</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grukkoh\" title=\"Grukkoh\">Grukkoh</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lann_Tarv\" title=\"Lann Tarv\">Lann Tarv</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Scrawny_Bugbear\" title=\"Scrawny Bugbear\">Scrawny Bugbear</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Severn\" title=\"Severn\">Severn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Stimk\" title=\"Stimk\">Stimk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Teghun\" title=\"Teghun\">Teghun</a></li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223900\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 737/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5120/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1789/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 682/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 694732/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.283      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   31.283      1 -total\n 32.98%   10.316      1 Template:DamageText\n 29.34%    9.178      1 Template:Damage_type\n 28.38%    8.877      1 Template:Icon_link\n 27.36%    8.559      1 Template:Icon_text\n 25.25%    7.900      6 Template:Trim\n 20.54%    6.424      1 Template:Ifempty\n 13.22%    4.137      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.32%    3.853      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4401-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714223900 and revision id 190142. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n<